qwen2.5-0.5b_harvested.md`\n- `ccnf-normalization-vs-parsing-harvested.md`\n- `losm-risk-management-harvested.md`\n- `nlp-output-harvested.md`\n- `semantic-ir-wrp-harvested.md`\n\n## Quality verification\nSpot-checked files at all candidate levels (1, 7, 9, 11). All match the benchmark DeepSeek V4 format: long-form Architectural Intent, actionable Requirements & Acceptance Criteria, code artifacts, and Unresolved Follow-Ups. The variance is in source material richness, not extraction quality.\n\n## Cross-reference constraint\nNo LICENSE, CONTRIBUTING, README, node_modules, or build-artifact references were found in the current CROSS_REFERENCES.md. The constraint is noted for upcoming cross-reference enhancement work.	ARCHITECTURE/reports/2026-06-20_deepseek-v4-harvest-promotion.md	{"date": "2026-06-20", "role": "architect", "summary": "Promoted 21 DeepSeek V4 harvests from incoming/chats to processed/harvests, replacing 4 overlapping qwen2.5:0.5b low-quality files", "_dirname": "ARCHITECTURE/reports", "_size_bytes": 2789, "_migrated_from": "ARCHITECTURE/reports/2026-06-20_deepseek-v4-harvest-promotion.md"}	{report,architect,ARCHITECTURE}	\N	\N	\N	\N	2026-06-21 02:12:31.004503+00	2026-06-21 02:12:31.004503+00	2026-06-21 02:12:31.004503+00	9999-12-31 23:59:59+00
