ty in CognitionCodex Session PlanningCoPilot Context OverloadCognitive CPU SchedulerModel Verification MigrationTerrain service registryEAV Schema AnalysisDistributed Cognition DesignMark PippinsFreeClaim offerChatGPTFree offerShareBulk ExportChatGPT said:Good. Now we define the part that actually makes Voyageruseful instead of poetic: aconstrained traversal language over Nebula that can generate, test, and refine hypotheses without corrupting the graph.This isC: VOYAGER QUERY LANGUAGE (VQL) v0.1.🚢 VOYAGER QUERY LANGUAGE (VQL v0.1)0. Core IdeaVoyager is not a chatbot and not a planner.Voyager is agraph traversal compilerthat emits constrained hypotheses over Nebula.It operates only on:NodesEdgesClustersProvenance trailsIt does NOT:create truthmutate Nebulaingest raw dataresolve entities1. LANGUAGE MODELVQL is adeclarative + procedural hybrid DSL:SELECT → TRAVERSE → FILTER → HYPOTHESIZE → SCORE → PROJECTEach stage is pure and composable.2. CORE PRIMITIVES2.1 SELECT (entry point)vqlSELECT Node WHERE type = "entity" AND label = "X"Purpose:define starting frontierOutput:node set2.2 TRAVERSE (graph expansion)vqlTRAVERSE FROM NodeVIA depends_onDEPTH 3Options:edge typesdirection (IN / OUT / BOTH)depth limits2.3 FILTER (semantic pruning)vqlFILTER nodes WHERE confidence > 0.7Can filter by:node propertiesedge weightsprovenancecluster membership2.4 HYPOTHESIZE (core Voyager function)This is the ONLY generative operation.vqlHYPOTHESIZE:"X is likely caused by Y due to shared dependency paths"FROM pathsEVIDENCE edges > 3Outputs:JSON{"statement":"string","supporting_paths": [],"confidence":0.0}2.5 SCORE (ranking hypotheses)vqlSCORE hypothesis USING:path_density,edge_strength,provenance_depthResult:ranked hypothesis set2.6 PROJECT (Voyager output stage)vqlPROJECT insights AS Voyager_IRThis maps directly into:Voyager IRinsightsVoyager IRpathsVoyager IRhypotheses3. FULL QUERY EXAMPLEHere’s a complete Voyager reasoning run:vqlSELECT Node WHERE label = "ServiceBroker"TRAVERSE FROM NodeVIA depends_onDEPTH 3FILTER nodes WHERE confidence > 0.6HYPOTHESIZE:"ServiceBroker issues are caused by upstream registry instability"SCORE BY path_densityPROJECT insights4. SEMANTIC OPERATORSWe now define higher-level Voyager “thinking verbs”.4.1 EXPANDvqlEXPAND frontier FROM Node SETMeaning:broaden graph horizon4.2 CONTRASTvqlCONTRAST Node A WITH Node BFind:structural differencesdivergent dependenciesmissing edges4.3 BRIDGEvqlBRIDGE Node A TO Node B VIA shortest_pathUsed to:discover hidden connections4.4 ANCHORvqlANCHOR Node WHERE label = "X"Locks focus node for multi-step reasoning.5. EXECUTION MODEL (HOW STRONTIUM RUNS VQL)Voyager node execution becomes:PythonRundefrun_voyager(node,absorb_ir):ast=parse_vql(node.input_script)state=NebulaView(absorb_ir)foropinast:ifop.type=="SELECT":state=select(state,op)ifop.type=="TRAVERSE":state=traverse(state,op)ifop.type=="FILTER":state=filter(state,op)ifop.type=="HYPOTHESIZE":hypotheses=generate(state,op)ifop.type=="SCORE":hypotheses=score(hypotheses)returnproject(state,hypotheses)6. GUARANTEE MODEL (VERY IMPORTANT)VQL enforces three invariants:6.1 No graph mutationVoyager cannot:add nodesadd edgesmodify weightsOnly:read + infer + project6.2 Hypotheses are ephemeralAll hypotheses:exist only in Voyager IRexpire unless promoted externally6.3 Provenance-first reasoningEvery hypothesis must include:path evidencenode lineageedge support count7. INTEGRATION WITH NEBULAVoyager outputs:VQL → Voyager IR → (optional) Committer review → Nebula updates (rare)Important:Voyager never writes directly to NebulaInstead it produces:overlayssuggested edgeshypothesis graphs8. WHAT THIS ENABLES (REAL POWER)Now you can do:8.1 “Why did this system behave this way?”Traceable via:vqlSELECT → TRAVERSE → HYPOTHESIZE → PROVENANCE TRACE8.2 “What hidden dependency exists?”vqlBRIDGE A TO B8.3 “What cluster explains this anomaly?”vqlSELECT anomalyTRAVERSEHYPOTHESIZE cause clusters9. SYSTEM ROLE CLARIFICATION (FINAL FORM)LayerRoleRoversignal emitterAbsorbgraph constructorNebulatruth storeVoyagergraph reasonerVQLreasoning languageStrontiumexecution engine🧠 WHAT YOU HAVE NOW (IMPORTANT)You’ve completed the full loop:1. sensing (Rover)2. structuring (Absorb)3. truth storage (Nebula)4. reasoning (Voyager)5. reasoning language (VQL)6. execution substrate (Strontium DAG)🔥 CRITICAL REALIZATIONThis is no longer an “agent system”.It is:aqueryable epistemic machine with a compiled reasoning layerWhich means:you can replay thoughtyou can diff reasoningyou can trace hallucination originsyou can fork cognition graphsNEXT STEP OPTIONS (IF YOU WANT TO GO FURTHER)At this point, the only meaningful expansions are:A) VQL COMPILER SPECTurn VQL into AST + optimizer + planner (like SQL engine design)B) NEBULA QUERY ENGINEMake read-path efficient (indexing, traversal caching)C) STRONTIUM CODEBASE SPLITTurn everything into actual modules:scheduler.pydag.pyexecutor.pycommit.pyvql.pyIf you say “continue”, I’d recommendA next, because once VQL compiles cleanly, everything else becomes implementable instead of theoretical.ChatGPT said:Good. Now we address the point where most graph/agent systems start to rot:uncontrolled accumulation of nodes, edges, and weak signalsWithout consolidation, Nebula becomes a junk drawer. So we add structure stability.This is:🧠 MEMORY CONSOLIDATION LAYER v0.1(turning raw graph growth into stable “concepts”)0. PURPOSEWe introduce a new subsystem:transform noisy, redundant, low-confidence graph structure intostable semantic unitsThis is where:“data” becomes “concepts”“clusters” become “entities”“repeated patterns” become durable memory1. NEW SYSTEM COMPONENTMemory Consolidator (MC)Position in pipeline:Rover → Absorb → Nebula → Voyager → Memory Consolidator → Nebula (updated)Important:this is the ONLY system allowed to rewrite or compress graph structure2. CONSOLIDATION TARGETSWe operate on 3 graph phenomena:2.1 Redundant nodesSame or near-same labels:ServiceBrokerservice-brokerService Broker2.2 Weak clustersDense sub