reasoning run:vqlSELECT Node WHERE label = "ServiceBroker"TRAVERSE FROM NodeVIA depends_onDEPTH 3FILTER nodes WHERE confidence > 0.6HYPOTHESIZE:"ServiceBroker issues are caused by upstream registry instability"SCORE BY path_densityPROJECT insights4. SEMANTIC OPERATORSWe now define higher-level Voyager “thinking verbs”.4.1 EXPANDvqlEXPAND frontier FROM Node SETMeaning:broaden graph horizon4.2 CONTRASTvqlCONTRAST Node A WITH Node BFind:structural differencesdivergent dependenciesmissing edges4.3 BRIDGEvqlBRIDGE Node A TO Node B VIA shortest_pathUsed to:discover hidden connections4.4 ANCHORvqlANCHOR Node WHERE label = "X"Locks focus node for multi-step reasoning.5. EXECUTION MODEL (HOW STRONTIUM RUNS VQL)Voyager node execution becomes:PythonRundefrun_voyager(node,absorb_ir):ast=parse_vql(node.input_script)state=NebulaView(absorb_ir)foropinast:ifop.type=="SELECT":state=select(state,op)ifop.type=="TRAVERSE":state=traverse(state,op)ifop.type=="FILTER":state=filter(state,op)ifop.type=="HYPOTHESIZE":hypotheses=generate(state,op)ifop.type=="SCORE":hypotheses=score(hypotheses)returnproject(state,hypotheses)6. GUARANTEE MODEL (VERY IMPORTANT)VQL enforces three invariants:6.1 No graph mutationVoyager cannot:add nodesadd edgesmodify weightsOnly:read + infer + project6.2 Hypotheses are ephemeralAll hypotheses:exist only in Voyager IRexpire unless promoted externally6.3 Provenance-first reasoningEvery hypothesis must include:path evidencenode lineageedge support count7. INTEGRATION WITH NEBULAVoyager outputs:VQL → Voyager IR → (optional) Committer review → Nebula updates (rare)Important:Voyager never writes directly to NebulaInstead it produces:overlayssuggested edgeshypothesis graphs8. WHAT THIS ENABLES (REAL POWER)Now you can do:8.1 “Why did this system behave this way?”Traceable via:vqlSELECT → TRAVERSE → HYPOTHESIZE → PROVENANCE TRACE8.2 “What hidden dependency exists?”vqlBRIDGE A TO B8.3 “What cluster explains this anomaly?”vqlSELECT anomalyTRAVERSEHYPOTHESIZE cause clusters9