,"source":"vision","entities":[{"id":"car_1","class":"vehicle","confidence":0.92},{"id":"person_2","class":"human","confidence":0.88}],"relations":[{"type":"inside","from":"person_2","to":"car_1"}],"temporal":"t=frame_1832","uncertainty":0.15}\n```\n\n### Unresolved Follow-Ups\n- What is the formal Percept IR schema — does it extend or compose with WorkRequest IR?\n- How does entity resolution work across frames — is identity tracking done by KG or by the Perception Compiler?\n\n---\n	{harvest,deepseek-v4}	{}	2026-06-21 02:09:39.93758+00	2026-06-21 02:09:39.93758+00	2026-06-21 02:09:39.93758+00	9999-12-31 23:59:59+00
